://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-v2/ep-04/s1-why.mp3"}, "key": "s1"}, {"name_es": "Tabla: familia + «to be»", "blocks": [{"t": "para", "en": "Let's use \"to be\" with family nouns and adjectives.", "es": "Usemos «to be» con palabras de la familia y adjetivos.", "audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-v2/ep-04/s2-p1.mp3", "wt": [0, 0.313, 0.499, 0.824, 1.324, 1.544, 1.892, 2.194, 2.322]}, {"t": "table", "head": ["Subject", "Verb", "Sentence"], "rows": [{"cells": ["My mom", "is", "My mom is sweet."], "audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-tables/ep-04/r1.mp3"}, {"cells": ["My brothers", "are", "My brothers are funny."], "audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-tables/ep-04/r2.mp3"}, {"cells": ["This", "is", "This is my sister."], "audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-tables/ep-04/r3.mp3"}, {"cells": ["They", "are", "They are my grandparents."], "audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-tables/ep-04/r4.mp3"}, {"cells": ["We", "are", "We are a big family."], "audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-tables/ep-04/r5.mp3"}]}], "task": {"type": "choose", "q_en": "Which is correct?", "q_es": "¿Cuál es correcta?", "options": [{"text": "This are my aunt.", "correct": false}, {"text": "This is my aunt.", "correct": true}, {"text": "This am my aunt.", "correct": false}], "why_en": "One person (this) → is.", "why_es": "Una sola persona (this) → is.", "q_audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-v2/ep-04/s2-q.mp3", "why_audio": "storage://course-media/0928ee68-d20b-4cdf-8e4b-5489ce16b4a3/grammar-v2/ep-04/s2-why.mp3"}, "key": "s2"}, {"name_es": "This is · These are", "blocks": [{"t": "para", "en": "Use \"this is\" when introducing one person:", "es": "Usa «this is» para presentar a una persona:", 